!engine/
!engine/**

# Never copy local dependencies, generated assets or private configuration.
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
**/.cargo/credentials
**/.cargo/credentials.toml
**/*credentials*
**/*secret*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/generated
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/artifacts
**/.cache
**/*.log
